WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The startup roadmap: six steps from a rough idea to your first customer.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1. Find a problem worth solving.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step 2. Test demand before you build.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step 3. Write a one-page plan.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step 4. Choose a structure and register.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step 5. Launch small.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Step 6. Measure and grow.
